@page "/about"
<PageTitle>Taniti : About</PageTitle>

<div class="card mb-4">
    <div class="row g-0">
        
        <div class="col-md-4">
            <img src="images/geography.jpg"
                 alt="Geography Image"
                 class="img-fluid rounded-start culture-image mx-auto d-block" />
        </div>
        
        <div class="col-md-8">
            <div class="card-header custom-header">
                Geography & Environment
            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
                <p class="card-text">
                    Taniti is a small, tropical island in the Pacific with diverse terrain and natural
                    features. Although the island covers less than 500 square miles, it offers a wide
                    range of landscapes and environments.
                </p>

                <ul class="list-group list-group-flush">
                    <li class="list-group-item">Small, tropical island in the Pacific</li>
                    <li class="list-group-item">Area of less than 500 square miles</li>
                    <li class="list-group-item">Sandy and rocky beaches</li>
                    <li class="list-group-item">Small but safe harbor</li>
                    <li class="list-group-item">Lush tropical rainforests</li>
                    <li class="list-group-item">Mountainous interior with small, active volcano</li>
                    @* <li class="list-group-item">Small, active volcano</li> *@
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>
</div>

<div class="card mb-4">
    <div class="row g-0">
        
        <div class="col-md-4">
            <img src="images/population.jpg"
                 alt="Population Image"
                 class="img-fluid rounded-start culture-image mx-auto d-block" />
        </div>
        
        <div class="col-md-8">
            <div class="card-header custom-header">
                Population
            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
                @* <h2 class="card-title">Population</h2> *@
                <p class="card-text">
                    Taniti is home to a close-knit indigenous community, with a population size that
                    reflects the island’s small geographic footprint.
                </p>

                <ul class="list-group list-group-flush">
                    <li class="list-group-item">Indigenous population of about 20,000</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>
</div>

<div class="card mb-4">
    <div class="row g-0">
        
        <div class="col-md-4">
            <img src="images/fishing.jpg"
                 alt="Economy Image"
                 class="img-fluid rounded-start culture-image mx-auto d-block" />
        </div>
        
        <div class="col-md-8">
            <div class="card-header custom-header">
                Historical Economy
            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
                <p class="card-text">
                    Before tourism began to grow, Taniti’s economy relied heavily on traditional
                    industries that supported the island’s residents for generations.
                </p>

                <ul class="list-group list-group-flush">
                    <li class="list-group-item">Economy historically dominated by fishing</li>
                    <li class="list-group-item">Agriculture was a major economic activity</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>
</div>
